3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQQtPGpX5EzpUwHPODp3gfx-KfWkn7FL5LkxQCYyjvE7qg&oe=6B071A0F"}, "display_name": "VENTA X", "keywords": ["VR", "POP", "3D", "Concert", "Music"], "long_description": "VENTA X is an app that boasts the largest collection of K-POP 3D VR videos worldwide, allowing you to easily and diversely enjoy high-quality 3D VR videos of K-POP artists, including music broadcasts and concerts.\n\nFans from 60 countries around the globe are meeting K-POP artists through VENTA X's immersive 8K 3D VR content, as if they are right in front of their eyes.\n\nDiscover the latest 8K 3D VR content of K-POP artists, updated weekly!\n\n[VENTA X Original content: 8K 3D VR MUSIC CINEMA]\n\u00b7 A performance that unfolds the artist's songs with movie-like stories.\n\u00b7 VR-optimized performances and immersive CG.\n\n[VENTA X K-POP Series content: 8K 3D VR performance VOD]\n\u00b7 Experience the diverse aspects of K-POP artists, including performances and variety shows, in a three-dimensional VR content.", "short_description": "Enjoy K-POP content produced in immersive 8K 3D VR! You can watch for extended periods without experiencing motion sickness, and the content is shot from an eye-level perspective, allowing you to have an experience of making eye contact with K-POP artists. There's a plethora of content available for you to enjoy!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "00_Logo(Transparent).png", "id": "1444402182919663", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003255_1444402186252996_7014711383928885591_n.png?_nc_cat=108&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=hbt8ylGPeZoQ7kNvwGRxvEK&_nc_oc=Adq9Y-36VMQQRqH4T6sA5oY6864VlJI40CYxqS5r3aUjruWF3EVZwb8a6mlGI4LBc4c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQStWczDjCgFpJsMPbdI9dq6X0AL_gxOw-RrEyLD84WYuw&oe=6B06F6DD"}, {"file_name": "03_portrait.png", "id": "1171362250588035", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_PORTR